y be done with  the invoker miranda also tends to luna  who is still alive it looks like miranda  will lead the darkmoon elves going  forward and she'll need luna their best  soldier  at the helm finally we get the invoker  saying the last line of the season to a  still living but badly beaten celemene  do you love me  this is a callback to episode 7 when she  asks the same thing of the invoker when  he pleads with her to save their child  do you love me  i love you it's not real love when  you're essentially forcing someone to  say it which is exactly what the invoker  is doing when he approaches celemene  whether or not celimany will say it i  guess we'll just have to wait for season  2. now as season 2 hasn't officially  been confirmed by netflix however  animatic editor robert meyer burnett  stated on a webcast that he's been  working on 24 episodes so it looks like  we'll at least be getting books 2 and 3.  i hope you'll like and subscribe as i  cover these shows thanks for watching  everyone for more bad takes you can  follow me on twitter and instagram  at thingstoryt until next time remember  daddy loves you very much  you

